-प्रचेतसो नाम सुचेतसः सुतान् अजीजनत्त्वत्करुणाङ्कुरानिव ॥ 19.1 ॥
-Word-by-word meaning: पृथोः of King Prithu, तु indeed, नप्ता great-grandson, पृथु-धर्म-कर्मठः devoted to great righteous deeds, प्राचीनबर्हिः King Prachinabarhis, युवतौ in his young wife, शतद्रुतौ Shatadruti, प्रचेतसः नाम named the Prachetas, सुचेतसः virtuous-minded, सुतान् sons, अजीजनत् begot, त्वत्-करुणा-अङ्कुरान इव as if they were the sprouts of Your mercy
-Simple Meaning: King Prachinabarhis, the great-grandson of King Prithu, was deeply devoted to performing righteous deeds. Through his young wife Shatadruti, he begot ten virtuous sons known by the group name of the Prachetas, who appeared like the very sprouts of Your mercy.
